WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.475 --> 00:00:02.475
- If you do wrong things

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:05.376
mainly harming other,

00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:07.818
you get negative consequences.

00:00:07.818 --> 00:00:10.370
Some say something good
person, some say bad person,

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:14.537
it doesn't matter so long my
own motivation for thinking

00:00:16.444 --> 00:00:18.685
is honest, sincere.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:23.210
When we investigate the reality,
our mind should be calm.

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:27.381
The basis of genuine friendship is trust.

00:00:27.381 --> 00:00:30.229
Trust depend on openness.

00:00:30.229 --> 00:00:33.507
- He's a monk of the Yellow
Hat school of Tibetan Buddhism.

00:00:33.507 --> 00:00:35.888
He's currently the 14th Dalai Lama.

00:00:35.888 --> 00:00:38.716
In 1989, he received a Nobel Peace Prize.

00:00:38.716 --> 00:00:40.660
He's the Dalai Lama, and here's my take

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.502
on his top 10 rules for success.

00:00:42.502 --> 00:00:44.468
Rule number two is my personal favorite,

00:00:44.468 --> 00:00:45.919
and I'm curious to see which one

00:00:45.919 --> 00:00:46.752
you guys like the best.

00:00:46.752 --> 00:00:48.311
As always, as the Dalai Lama is speaking,

00:00:48.311 --> 00:00:50.620
if he says something that's
really inspiring to you,

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:52.230
make sure to leave it
in the comments below

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:53.998
and put quotes around it so other people

00:00:53.998 --> 00:00:56.472
can be inspired as well.

00:00:56.472 --> 00:00:59.055
(upbeat music)

00:01:09.098 --> 00:01:11.031
- The ultimate source of

00:01:11.031 --> 00:01:13.364
satisfaction within ourself.

00:01:14.812 --> 00:01:16.812
- If you do wrong things

00:01:17.842 --> 00:01:19.800
mainly harming other,

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:22.300
you get negative consequences.

00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:26.054
If you do helping other,

00:01:26.054 --> 00:01:28.140
bring more happiness to other

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.034
you get benefit.

00:01:30.034 --> 00:01:32.693
More inner strength there

00:01:32.693 --> 00:01:36.526
and more sort of confidence
of purpose of life

00:01:37.506 --> 00:01:39.560
and fulfillment about that purpose,

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:41.894
then you always feel happy.

00:01:41.894 --> 00:01:46.133
If the rest of the people
really feel that me

00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:49.371
as a politician or
further a bad politician,

00:01:49.371 --> 00:01:50.722
then I feel sad.

00:01:50.722 --> 00:01:52.972
(laughter)

00:01:56.845 --> 00:01:58.320
Or a cunning, liar politician

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:01.570
then of course, no problem, no problem.

00:02:03.601 --> 00:02:06.448
Some say something good
person, some say bad person,

00:02:06.448 --> 00:02:10.031
it doesn't matter so
long my own motivation

00:02:10.912 --> 00:02:13.579
for thinking is honest, sincere.

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:16.866
That's the important.

00:02:16.866 --> 00:02:18.633
That's simple Buddhist monks.

00:02:18.633 --> 00:02:21.616
Actually, Buddha as he taught.

00:02:21.616 --> 00:02:24.866
Don't care what others saying.

00:02:24.866 --> 00:02:28.196
If one say too much
praise, then at that time

00:02:28.196 --> 00:02:32.216
should think, Oh, I also have the critics.

00:02:32.216 --> 00:02:37.209
Then, one say a lot criticism,
then you should think,

00:02:37.209 --> 00:02:39.050
Oh, some people are praising me.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:40.883
So, it doesn't matter.

00:02:42.073 --> 00:02:44.905
Too much sort of paying much attention

00:02:44.905 --> 00:02:47.306
these things are silly.

00:02:47.306 --> 00:02:49.806
Ultimate source of happy life

00:02:51.996 --> 00:02:54.217
is our inner value.

00:02:54.217 --> 00:02:56.012
So therefore,

00:02:56.012 --> 00:02:58.536
irrespective of a believer or nonbeliever,

00:02:58.536 --> 00:03:01.036
whether it be religion or not.

00:03:02.694 --> 00:03:05.444
See, we should pay more attention

00:03:06.488 --> 00:03:08.321
about our inner world.

00:03:09.567 --> 00:03:10.734
Now scientist,

00:03:12.931 --> 00:03:16.264
according latest of scientific findings,

00:03:17.379 --> 00:03:19.129
it now sort of clear,

00:03:20.858 --> 00:03:23.608
even good health or healthy body,

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:29.156
the healthy mind is very essential.

00:03:30.169 --> 00:03:31.669
More peaceful mind

00:03:34.258 --> 00:03:36.212
brings healthy body

00:03:36.212 --> 00:03:37.712
because mind calm,

00:03:40.899 --> 00:03:43.482
peaceful, then our body element

00:03:46.857 --> 00:03:49.357
also then remain more balance.

00:03:51.398 --> 00:03:53.731
So that brings healthy body.

00:03:55.717 --> 00:03:57.050
Too much stress,

00:03:57.957 --> 00:03:59.207
too much worry,

00:04:01.498 --> 00:04:03.581
disturb our body element.

00:04:05.631 --> 00:04:08.714
That creates certain sort of problems

00:04:09.794 --> 00:04:11.436
in what is body.

00:04:11.436 --> 00:04:14.977
So therefore, calm mind is very essential.

00:04:14.977 --> 00:04:18.060
I think you should realize that anger

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:22.710
may bring some kind of energy,

00:04:23.761 --> 00:04:26.459
short moment, for a short period.

00:04:26.459 --> 00:04:29.876
But that energy is actually blind energy.

00:04:31.568 --> 00:04:33.568
And anger really destroy

00:04:36.641 --> 00:04:39.891
your part of your brain which can judge

00:04:43.694 --> 00:04:44.944
right or wrong.

00:04:45.865 --> 00:04:48.448
So when we fully develop anger,

00:04:50.218 --> 00:04:52.301
we can't see the reality.

00:04:53.224 --> 00:04:55.974
So that energy, more bold, right?

00:04:57.463 --> 00:05:00.130
But that energy is blind energy.

00:05:03.275 --> 00:05:05.942
So in order to face the problem,

00:05:09.526 --> 00:05:13.542
our method should be, as I
mentioned earlier, realistic.

00:05:13.542 --> 00:05:16.459
In order to carry realistic method,

00:05:17.874 --> 00:05:20.041
you must know the reality.

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:23.113
When we look the reality,

00:05:24.619 --> 00:05:27.229
when we investigate the reality,

00:05:27.229 --> 00:05:29.728
our mind should be calm.

00:05:29.728 --> 00:05:33.561
Otherwise we cannot see
the thing objectively.

00:05:35.532 --> 00:05:39.449
So in order to use human
intelligence properly,

00:05:41.732 --> 00:05:44.519
our mind should be calm.

00:05:44.519 --> 00:05:46.602
So taking this line anger

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:51.113
is firstly destroy your inner peace.

00:05:51.113 --> 00:05:55.280
Secondly, destroy your ability
to investigate the reality.

00:05:58.439 --> 00:06:00.272
So you think this way,

00:06:01.644 --> 00:06:04.477
then once you have clear evidence,

00:06:06.601 --> 00:06:09.434
anger is no use, only destruction.

00:06:11.278 --> 00:06:14.361
Affection, or compassionate attitude,

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.723
warmheartedness,

00:06:17.723 --> 00:06:19.640
is very, very important

00:06:21.489 --> 00:06:23.923
for one's own well being,

00:06:23.923 --> 00:06:26.065
for one's own happiness.

00:06:26.065 --> 00:06:28.747
So don't consider practice of compassion

00:06:28.747 --> 00:06:30.825
is something religious matter,

00:06:30.825 --> 00:06:34.257
or practice of compassion
is something good for other,

00:06:34.257 --> 00:06:36.038
not necessarily to oneself.

00:06:36.038 --> 00:06:38.587
That is totally mistake.

00:06:38.587 --> 00:06:40.670
So, since from childhood,

00:06:42.716 --> 00:06:44.822
we already equipped

00:06:44.822 --> 00:06:46.822
this seed of compassion,

00:06:47.754 --> 00:06:51.098
we learn from mother and ourself

00:06:51.098 --> 00:06:53.355
in order to become parent,

00:06:53.355 --> 00:06:55.272
the seed already there.

00:06:56.397 --> 00:06:59.515
Now that seed, you must keep,

00:06:59.515 --> 00:07:01.265
nurture all our life.

00:07:03.096 --> 00:07:06.440
The biological factor
compassion is limited,

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:10.357
biased, and more dependent
on other's attitude.

00:07:11.963 --> 00:07:14.043
Now that as a seed.

00:07:14.043 --> 00:07:16.460
Then using reasons, evidence,

00:07:18.166 --> 00:07:20.166
that seed of compassion,

00:07:21.692 --> 00:07:23.275
can further develop

00:07:25.749 --> 00:07:27.416
unbiased compassion.

00:07:31.429 --> 00:07:33.363
Not depend on other's attitude

00:07:33.363 --> 00:07:36.030
but rather other's being itself.

00:07:36.966 --> 00:07:41.654
So that kind of compassion
can reach your enemy,

00:07:41.654 --> 00:07:43.737
or entire sense of being.

00:07:45.083 --> 00:07:48.876
So that compassion is infinite compassion,

00:07:48.876 --> 00:07:51.959
unbiased compassion, real compassion.

00:07:54.797 --> 00:07:57.880
So if we become compassionate person,

00:07:59.533 --> 00:08:02.283
then your life become meaningful.

00:08:04.772 --> 00:08:07.022
Because you yourself happy,

00:08:09.775 --> 00:08:11.025
calm, peaceful,

00:08:12.924 --> 00:08:15.507
your friend, including animals,

00:08:17.103 --> 00:08:18.936
also should get peace.

00:08:19.867 --> 00:08:22.367
So at the last day of our life

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:25.242
you feel happy.

00:08:25.242 --> 00:08:26.242
All my life,

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:28.223
I'll spend

00:08:30.269 --> 00:08:31.852
peaceful, friendly.

00:08:33.806 --> 00:08:35.639
You really feel happy.

00:08:37.185 --> 00:08:39.352
Otherwise, at that moment,

00:08:40.948 --> 00:08:43.346
even you're a billionaire,

00:08:43.346 --> 00:08:46.096
ghost money, nothing can be used.

00:08:47.708 --> 00:08:50.687
No matter, what good cause of a good body,

00:08:50.687 --> 00:08:52.104
a beautiful body.

00:08:53.007 --> 00:08:55.424
All everything have to leave.

00:08:56.925 --> 00:09:00.551
So at that time, I think
genuine satisfaction

00:09:00.551 --> 00:09:05.343
can bring if your whole life
spend more compassionate life,

00:09:05.343 --> 00:09:07.343
then you feel no regret.

00:09:09.712 --> 00:09:13.731
So purposeful life is
naturally happy life,

00:09:13.731 --> 00:09:15.064
meaningful life.

00:09:15.951 --> 00:09:19.119
So in order to make meaningful life,

00:09:19.119 --> 00:09:22.659
ultimately, warmheartedness is to give it.

00:09:22.659 --> 00:09:26.576
Then another important
factor is determination.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:34.277
And you should not think these development

00:09:34.277 --> 00:09:38.110
can take place within a
few days or few years.

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:42.260
We must understand.

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:46.323
You see that these developments
even may take eons.

00:09:46.323 --> 00:09:48.573
(laughter)

00:09:49.589 --> 00:09:52.006
So you see our determination,

00:09:53.724 --> 00:09:55.729
if you consider as a Buddhist

00:09:55.729 --> 00:09:59.562
and one who really
practice the Buddha dharma,

00:10:01.188 --> 00:10:02.806
then right from the beginning,

00:10:02.806 --> 00:10:05.550
you must, you see, make up your mind,

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:08.597
doesn't matter even may take millions

00:10:08.597 --> 00:10:10.826
of billions of billions of eons.

00:10:10.826 --> 00:10:12.326
It doesn't matter.

00:10:16.915 --> 00:10:20.677
After all, what is the
purpose of our life,

00:10:20.677 --> 00:10:22.889
the meaning of existence?

00:10:22.889 --> 00:10:23.722
Nothing.

00:10:24.794 --> 00:10:27.853
You realize something positive.

00:10:27.853 --> 00:10:32.074
Then, you see, even days and month or eon,

00:10:32.074 --> 00:10:33.491
it is meaningful.

00:10:35.432 --> 00:10:39.962
If you really wasting a
life, the purpose of a life,

00:10:39.962 --> 00:10:42.212
then even one day too long.

00:10:45.587 --> 00:10:49.754
So once you determined,
once you make up your mind,

00:10:50.659 --> 00:10:53.373
some kind of firm determination,

00:10:53.373 --> 00:10:55.623
and clear to objective way,

00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:59.848
then time is not important.

00:10:59.848 --> 00:11:03.747
(speaking in foreign language)

00:11:03.747 --> 00:11:05.760
It is so long space remain,

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:07.677
so long sentient beings

00:11:09.465 --> 00:11:11.330
suffering remain,

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:13.997
I will remain in order to serve.

00:11:15.642 --> 00:11:17.626
You see that sentence really gives me

00:11:17.626 --> 00:11:19.668
some kind of understand,

00:11:19.668 --> 00:11:22.527
and also I think inspiring.

00:11:22.527 --> 00:11:24.444
So the more impatience,

00:11:25.451 --> 00:11:27.632
and as I mentioned before you today,

00:11:27.632 --> 00:11:30.963
want something the quickest
or best or something,

00:11:30.963 --> 00:11:34.086
then I can reserve all the Buddhist idea.

00:11:34.086 --> 00:11:36.850
(laughter)

00:11:36.850 --> 00:11:38.212
The quickest, cheapest method,

00:11:38.212 --> 00:11:40.979
it is seldom will be Buddhist.

00:11:40.979 --> 00:11:42.760
So you see that's, I think, wrong.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:46.786
So that I would like to share with you.

00:11:46.786 --> 00:11:48.117
So that's where I use it.

00:11:48.117 --> 00:11:51.436
I myself also recite this as a mantra,

00:11:51.436 --> 00:11:54.752
or as some visualization
or certain mandalas.

00:11:54.752 --> 00:11:57.505
But in my daily practice,

00:11:57.505 --> 00:12:00.614
although my practice very poor, very poor,

00:12:00.614 --> 00:12:04.004
but even then I admire the main emphasis

00:12:04.004 --> 00:12:05.741
on this form

00:12:05.741 --> 00:12:06.991
and Bodhicitta,

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:10.976
and koruna.

00:12:10.976 --> 00:12:14.710
So that really I feel
is something practical.

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:16.118
Then through this practice

00:12:16.118 --> 00:12:19.660
you will get something practical benefit.

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:22.828
Visualization was big in the 80s.

00:12:22.828 --> 00:12:25.211
Sometimes I think they

00:12:25.211 --> 00:12:26.370
cheating oneself

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:28.803
almost like this like
this is cheating oneself.

00:12:28.803 --> 00:12:29.961
- [Monk] Deceiving oneself.

00:12:29.961 --> 00:12:31.628
- Deceiving oneself.

00:12:33.339 --> 00:12:34.422
So therefore,

00:12:36.004 --> 00:12:39.087
I think, you see, we must receive practice

00:12:39.087 --> 00:12:40.087
step by step

00:12:41.176 --> 00:12:44.009
with patience, with determination.

00:12:45.486 --> 00:12:48.153
Once you involve, are dedicated,

00:12:49.395 --> 00:12:51.630
or determined to practice,

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:54.627
then some improvement you can see.

00:12:54.627 --> 00:12:58.120
You see year by year or decade
by at least decade by decade,

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:01.620
then you can see oh, at least some change,

00:13:02.463 --> 00:13:04.880
some improvement you can see.

00:13:05.889 --> 00:13:10.056
Once you see that, that
also gives you some kind of

00:13:11.358 --> 00:13:14.739
- [Together] New encouragement.

00:13:14.739 --> 00:13:18.478
- So, to change, not easy, not easy.

00:13:18.478 --> 00:13:21.395
When we feel a sense of irritation,

00:13:24.115 --> 00:13:27.459
during that moment if that person

00:13:27.459 --> 00:13:30.376
concentrate fully on the breathing,

00:13:31.795 --> 00:13:32.878
nothing else,

00:13:34.427 --> 00:13:36.677
breathing, one, two, three,

00:13:38.546 --> 00:13:40.379
like five, 10, 15, 20.

00:13:41.666 --> 00:13:46.142
When you start bringing,
mental state irritated.

00:13:46.142 --> 00:13:49.309
But then after 20, 30, sort breathing,

00:13:51.022 --> 00:13:55.347
your mental state will
be little different,

00:13:55.347 --> 00:13:56.988
little more calm.

00:13:56.988 --> 00:13:59.905
Since we are dealing with emotions,

00:14:01.249 --> 00:14:04.062
so the best method to deal with that

00:14:04.062 --> 00:14:07.715
is through the so-called mediation.

00:14:07.715 --> 00:14:10.548
Not for next life, not for Heaven,

00:14:11.938 --> 00:14:14.605
but for day to day's well-being.

00:14:15.971 --> 00:14:18.698
- [Host] Do you believe
that your time here

00:14:18.698 --> 00:14:19.931
on earth has been a success?

00:14:19.931 --> 00:14:20.764
- Success?

00:14:24.709 --> 00:14:26.997
That also relative.

00:14:26.997 --> 00:14:27.830
Some field

00:14:28.846 --> 00:14:30.707
I think some achievement there

00:14:30.707 --> 00:14:33.110
and some field, failure.

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:35.681
So, difficult to say.

00:14:35.681 --> 00:14:38.679
I know all human life like that.

00:14:38.679 --> 00:14:42.075
Some part failure, some part achieve.

00:14:42.075 --> 00:14:44.886
(laughter)

00:14:44.886 --> 00:14:48.469
It is wrong to pick up
one thing, then say,

00:14:49.337 --> 00:14:50.602
"Oh, very success."

00:14:50.602 --> 00:14:52.186
Is wrong.

00:14:52.186 --> 00:14:56.704
And pick up one thing,
failure, that also wrong.

00:14:56.704 --> 00:14:58.240
Things are relative.

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:00.528
We are social animal.

00:15:00.528 --> 00:15:03.111
We human beings, social animal.

00:15:04.609 --> 00:15:07.359
And particularly, in modern time,

00:15:08.353 --> 00:15:10.103
the reality, economy,

00:15:11.045 --> 00:15:15.212
environment, and many things
heavily interdependent.

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:19.123
That is reality.

00:15:21.269 --> 00:15:22.436
Unlike I think

00:15:24.289 --> 00:15:26.252
past is sort of ancient time.

00:15:26.252 --> 00:15:30.454
Ancient time all this
independent, self-sufficient,

00:15:30.454 --> 00:15:35.365
as in not dependent, your
interest or your future

00:15:35.365 --> 00:15:37.444
not depend on other.

00:15:37.444 --> 00:15:39.361
Now completely changed.

00:15:41.688 --> 00:15:45.093
So even from this selfish viewpoint

00:15:45.093 --> 00:15:49.806
you have to take care
about others' well-being.

00:15:49.806 --> 00:15:52.139
You just think of your self,

00:15:54.062 --> 00:15:58.226
blind selfish, think for
yourself, forget other,

00:15:58.226 --> 00:16:01.124
or worse thing, exploit other,

00:16:01.124 --> 00:16:05.291
cheating other, bullying
other, ultimately you suffer.

00:16:06.902 --> 00:16:09.971
Through these mischievous way you may gain

00:16:09.971 --> 00:16:14.161
some temporary sort of
benefit but deep inside

00:16:14.161 --> 00:16:16.881
you feel uncomfortable.

00:16:16.881 --> 00:16:21.186
Then eventually, you truly
become lonely person.

00:16:21.186 --> 00:16:24.269
Nobody loves you, nobody respect you.

00:16:25.352 --> 00:16:27.131
If you take care of other,

00:16:27.131 --> 00:16:30.548
as a human brother or sisters, sincerely,

00:16:33.564 --> 00:16:37.314
seriously, then everybody
become your friend.

00:16:40.788 --> 00:16:44.455
So when you have truly
trusted friend there,

00:16:45.599 --> 00:16:49.140
if you need something you can ask them.

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:52.723
If you becoming friendless
or lonely person

00:16:54.279 --> 00:16:57.477
and when you really facing some problems,

00:16:57.477 --> 00:16:59.227
nobody you can share.

00:17:01.123 --> 00:17:04.255
So ultimately, we are social animal.

00:17:04.255 --> 00:17:06.005
So even other animal,

00:17:07.371 --> 00:17:10.204
no law, no education, no religion,

00:17:11.856 --> 00:17:13.458
but you see,

00:17:13.458 --> 00:17:15.889
they have some kind of sort of feeling.

00:17:15.889 --> 00:17:19.575
Their own individual survival depend

00:17:19.575 --> 00:17:21.514
on rest of the community or herds

00:17:21.514 --> 00:17:23.029
so they work together.

